<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now although I’m still kind of small,</l><l>And the future is in front of me.</l><l>In my heart I’ve heard the Lord’s call,</l><l>Just to follow Him absolutely.</l><l>Though the path may be holding</l><l>Much joy or much pain,</l><l>What matters is that more of Him I would gain,</l><l>Regardless what happens,</l><l>I never would change.</l><l>’Cause I’m made to be filled with the Lord.</l><l>Yes, I’m made to be filled with the Lord.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
